{
  "slug": "andie",
  "name": "Andie",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Andie - the sharpest thinking partner inside Claude Code. \nAndie doesn't summarize — it debates, war-games, and dissects until the answer survives scrutiny. \nFour modes: \nDeep (world-class expert breaks it down Feynman-style), \nDrama (expert panel fights your decision to a conclusion), \nTriage (war strategy applied to your crisis in real time), \nKaizen (finds the waste, fixes one thing, locks it in). \nAutomatically picks up and loads specialist skills — AWS-GCP-Azure-OCI, multiple tools like Kafka, Postgres, security, ML, and more — so every answer comes from someone who's actually done the work.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `andie` (Compact plan-first orchestration layer), `andie-guru` (Feynman-style explainer for Andie and specialist output), `andie-jr` (Compact brownfield debug assistant), `tools-landscape` (Tool and product registry for Andie pre-flight)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install andie@claude-community` from `giggsoinc/andie`.",
